[68.396375, "o", "proposed 5729ff8f2fa2b2f3f2571ac3ee0e47c3 as agent-derived; `ljos accept 5729ff8f2fa2b2f3f2571ac3ee0e47c3` writes it\r\ndid not fire the island for \"Ship the fuse change\": its seeds are hits no two scorers agreed on; wiring them would tighten the wrong links\r\ncompleted the session node for demo-nr1s as done\r\nthe ticket demo-nr1s keeps its state; `ljos finish demo-nr1s --close` or `vissue update demo-nr1s -s DONE` closes it when the work is accepted\r\ntracker git: committed chore(issues): demo-nr1s finished; not pushed (LJOS_TRACKER_GIT=commit)\r\n"]
